    dc:title "Alpha2u-microglobulin cytotoxicity leading to renal tubular adenomas and carcinomas (in male rat)" ;
    dcterms:abstract """This putative adverse outcome pathway (AOP) outlines potential key events leading to a tumor outcome in standard carcinogenicity models. This information is based largely on modes of action described previously in cited literature sources and is intended as a resource template for AOP development and data organization. Presentation in this Wiki does not indicate EPA acceptance of a particular pathway for a given reference agent, only that the information has been proposed in some manner. In addition, this putative AOP relates to the model species indicated and does not directly address issues of human relevance.
""" ;
    dcterms:alternative "α2u-globulin- renal adenomas/carcinomas" ;
    dcterms:created "2016-11-29T18:41:16" ;
